  "description": "Bring familiar LINQ queries to CSV and XLSX files. Work with typed C# objects, stream results, create files, and append or insert records in either format. Export to paths or streams, with date formats, boolean/null tokens, and custom converters. .NET 10+, Native AOT, and no extra runtime package dependencies.",
